> GENERATED from `github-actions-combinatorial-pack/ontology.ttl`. Do not hand-edit.

The crown objective is **verified GitHub consequence**, not fidelity to a laptop transport.
The capability graph is open-world: preserve lawful routes and Marketplace candidates,
then admit a bounded dependency-closed projection. A failed edge is topology.

